//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
// Runs a conversation of three turns with `scripts/chat.py --check`, which drives a session of
// `src/main.vx`. Each turn must give the text of a fresh run of the same prompt, and the second
// and third turns must reuse the KV cache of the turns before them. A cache saved after the second
// turn must give the third turn the same text in a new session. The tiny model has the 404 tokens
// of the tiny tokenizer, so that it can take text.
//
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/make_tiny_model.py --vocab-size 404 --max-positions 1024 %t.vxw > /dev/null
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/make_tiny_tokenizer.py %t.json > /dev/null
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/convert_tokenizer.py --any-unicode %t.json %t.vxt > /dev/null
// RUN: python3 %S/../scripts/chat.py %t.vxw %t.vxt --context 512 --check | FileCheck %s
//
// CHECK: {{^}}turn 1: prompt {{[0-9]+}} tokens, reused False, same text as a fresh run: True{{$}}
// CHECK: {{^}}turn 2: prompt {{[0-9]+}} tokens, reused True, same text as a fresh run: True{{$}}
// CHECK: {{^}}saved: True{{$}}
// CHECK: {{^}}turn 3: prompt {{[0-9]+}} tokens, reused True, same text as a fresh run: True{{$}}
// CHECK: {{^}}loaded: True{{$}}
// CHECK: {{^}}turn 3 after the load: reused True, same text as the first session: True{{$}}
